# Plugins Bindings for `default` Lifecycle Reference

The [`default` lifecycle](./lifecycles.html) is defined without any plugin binding; plugins bindings are defined separately in [`org.apache.maven.lifecycle.providers.packaging`](./apidocs/org/apache/maven/lifecycle/providers/packaging/package-summary.html) package because they are specific for each packaging:

<!-- MACRO{toc|fromDepth=2} -->

